Implemented the Supabase shell plugin under `plugins/supabase/` only.

Changed:
- `plugins/supabase/plugin.go`
- `plugins/supabase/supabase.go`
- `plugins/supabase/access_token.go`
- `plugins/supabase/access_token_test.go`
- `plugins/supabase/test-fixtures/access-token`

What it does:
- Registers the `supabase` plugin and `Supabase CLI` executable.
- Uses a Supabase `Access Token` credential.
- Provisions auth via documented `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN`.
- Imports from:
  - `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN`
  - `~/.supabase/access-token`
- Skips auth for help/version/no-args/login/logout cases.
- Includes plugintest coverage for provisioner and importer.

