Ambiguity/escalation note:
- Supabase CLI also uses native OS credential storage when available. This plugin imports the documented environment variable and plaintext fallback token file, but does not import from OS keychain/keyring because existing plugin importer helpers are file/env oriented and the task prohibited edits outside `plugins/supabase/`.
